### Crear un usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document_type": "CC",
  "document_number": "123456789",
  "first_name": "Juan",
  "middle_name": "Carlos",
  "last_name": "Pérez",
  "second_last_name": "Gómez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
  "phone_number": "3001234567",
  "profile_photo": "https://example.com/photo.jpg",
  "status": "active",
  "password": "password123",
  "userProfileId": 1,
  "birth_date": "1990-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Obtener todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Buscar usuarios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/search?searchTerm=Juan

### Obtener usuario por ID (reemplaza 1 con un ID válido)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/1

### Actualizar usuario (reemplaza 1 con un ID válido)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Juan Updated",
  "status": "inactive"
}

### Eliminar usuario (reemplaza 1 con un ID válido)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/1